527	642	After the government's defeat in the 1985 elections, Vitorino became a deputy secretary for the Governor of Macau.

642	751	In 1989, Vitorino returned to Lisbon to become a judge of the Constitutional Court, ending his term in 1994.

751	876	In 1995, Vitorino became Minister for National Defence and Deputy Prime Minister in the first government of António Guterres.
877	935	He resigned in 1997 for being suspected of tax evasion.



